---

<Layout
  title="Kindergarten Field Trip to Bannerghatta National Park - Icon School of Excellence"
  description="Discover the excitement of our kindergarten students' field trip to Bannerghatta National Park. A fun and educational day filled with wildlife, nature exploration, and lasting memories."
  keywords="kindergarten field trip, Bannerghatta National Park, Icon School of Excellence, wildlife exploration, educational trip, student activities, nature learning, school field trips, memorable experiences"
  robots="index, follow"
  canonical="https://iconschoolofexcellence.com/events/field-trip2/"
>
  <EventsList
    event_title="Field Trip"
    event_sub_title="Kindergarten Field Trip to Bannerghatta National Park"
    paragraph=`Our kindergarteners embarked on an exciting field trip to Bannerghatta National Park. The children explored the park, enjoyed a thrilling safari ride, and observed animals like lions, tigers, and elephants up close.

They also visited the butterfly park, where colorful butterflies delighted everyone. The trip was both educational and fun, sparking curiosity and fostering a love for nature.

It was a memorable day filled with learning, laughter, and adventure, leaving our little ones with cherished memories of their first wildlife experience.`
    images={images}
  />
</Layout>
